/topics/17-srv6-mpls/", "title": "SRv6 / MPLS / Path Tracing", "content_html": "SRv6 / MPLS / Path Tracing \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u3067 SRv6\uff08Segment Routing over IPv6\uff09\u3001MPLS\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u7d4c\u8def\u89b3\u6e2c\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306e Path Tracing \u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u3066\u8aad\u3080\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/17-srv6-mpls/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T02:18:58+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:31:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/17-srv6-mpls/operations/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/17-srv6-mpls/operations/", "title": "\u904b\u7528", "content_html": "SRv6 / MPLS / Path Tracing \u306e\u904b\u7528\u78ba\u8a8d\u306f\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u304c CONFIG_DB \u306b\u6b63\u3057\u304f\u5165\u3063\u305f\u304b\u300d\u300cFRR / netlink \u7d4c\u7531\u3067 APP_DB \u306b\u6e21\u3063\u305f\u304b\u300d\u300cSAI / ASIC \u306b programming \u3055\u308c\u305f\u304b\u300d\u306e\u4e09\u6bb5\u3092\u9806\u306b\u8ffd\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5404\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e\u51fa\u53e3\uff08show \u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 / DB / \u30ed\u30b0\uff09\u3068\u5178\u578b\u7684\u306a\u7570\u5e38\u30d1\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u5b9f\u4f8b\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u3067\u6574\u7406\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/17-srv6-mpls/operations.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T02:18:58+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:31:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/17-srv6-mpls/concept/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/17-srv6-mpls/concept/", "title": "\u6982\u5ff5", "content_html": "SRv6 / MPLS / Path Tracing \u304c SONiC \u306e\u901a\u5e38 routing \u3068\u3069\u3053\u3067\u5206\u5c90\u3057\u3001\u3069\u306e daemon \u3068 DB \u3092\u5897\u3084\u3059\u304b\u3092 1 \u7ae0\u3067\u898b\u6e21\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/17-srv6-mpls/concept.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T02:18:27+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:31:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-tunnel/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-tunnel/", "title": "sonic-tunnel YANG", "content_html": "sonic-tunnel YANG \u2014 DualToR \u69cb\u6210\u306b\u304a\u3051\u308b MuxTunnel (IPinIP encap/decap) \u306e\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u3002DSCP / ECN / TTL \u306e handling mode\u3001 encap/decap QoS map \u306a\u3069\u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-tunnel.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T02:17:56+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:06:13+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/", "title": "\u5909\u66f4\u5c65\u6b74", "content_html": "\u5909\u66f4\u5c65\u6b74 \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f merged PR \u306e\u30e1\u30bf\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u304b\u3089 meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py \u3067\u6a5f\u68b0\u751f\u6210\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u624b\u3067\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3067\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T02:17:24+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:29:31+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": ["changelog", "meta"]}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/", "url": "ht